OL,3,GNEWSAEverybody was as one: Rector
OL,4,Areflects on search effort for Noah
OL,5,AWoods
OL,6,
OL,7,FAt least 1,300 people helped to try to
OL,8,Ffind him in the following 24 hours,
OL,9,Fbefore a child's body was discovered on
OL,10,FWednesday afternoon at a nearby pond.
OL,11,FPolice confirmed on Thursday the body
OL,12,Fhad been identified as Noah's.
OL,14,F"Everybody was as one," said the
OL,15,FReverend Chris Willis.
